# Valgrind (Memcheck) suppressions for the valgrind test run (see t/README.md).
#
# This file baselines KNOWN, pre-existing leaks so the valgrind gate can
# still catch NEW ones.  Each entry names the bug it hides; remove the
# entry as part of the fix so the exercising test turns into live leak
# coverage.
#
# There are currently no known leaks.
